        "type": "send",
        "subject": "RFQ 26-0812: quantity and drawing clarifications",
        "body": "Hello Purchasing Team,\n\nWe are preparing our quote for the hanging KVM mount brackets. Please clarify the following:\n\n1. Quantity: The email requests 750 units plus one first article (751 total), while specification sections 1 and 4 call for 800 units including the first article. Which quantity should we quote, and is the first article included or additional?\n\n2. Drawing revision: The email references Rev A and a sheet re-issued under amendment 0001 on 30 July. The supplied sheet has no revision marking. Please confirm the revision to use and provide the identified re-issued sheet.\n\n3. Drawing number: We could not find a drawing number on the supplied sheet. Please provide the drawing number to reference in our quote, or confirm that none is assigned.\n\n4. General tolerance: Specification section 3 gives +/- 0.010 inch only as a bracketed example, and the drawing states no general tolerance. Please confirm the required general fabrication tolerance.\n\n5. Dimension units: The overall dimensions are shown as 20.000 × 14.500 without a unit designation. Please confirm the units for these dimensions and the drawing callouts.\n\nThank you. Waiting for your answer",
        "covers": [
